# Coarse-grained mW water: one sphere represents one WHOLE H2O molecule.
# Start from cubic ice (Ic), then supply heat from a bath. No explicit hydrogen
# atoms, water rotations, chemical reactions or individual H-bond energies.
#/atom 1 1.05 #9CE7FF
units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
lattice diamond 6.3584
region box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 18.01528
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 1.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
minimize 1e-8 1e-6 1000 10000
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 200.0 49183 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
variable bath equal ternary(step<1000,200.0,ternary(step<7000,200.0+180.0*(step-1000.0)/6000.0,380.0))
fix thermal all langevin v_bath 380.0 100.0 82347 zero yes
timestep 5.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step atoms temp pe ke etotal
run 0
